+/// The most capstones [`PreparedImage::detect_grids`] groups. An image
+/// with more gives no grids at all: quirc's own limit, which is ten codes'
+/// worth and a few false ones besides. (Sukkula.)
+pub const MAX_CAPSTONES: usize = 32;
